    "body": "After merging #773 and updating this PR here is the fps I'm seeing with wavefront kernel and the rover model at a stack size of 60:\r\n\r\n| Workgroup space (shared stack) | Private space | Function space |\r\n|---|---|---|\r\n| ~55-63fps | ~79-84fps | ~79-84fps |\r\n",
